        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n1 Lorrin Lodge is a fantastic 4 bedroom plus study A Rated house in this superb development in Rathnew. The property measures approx. 139m2.\n\nLorrin Lodge is an exciting development in Rathnew, Co. Wicklow, designed to offer modern living in a picturesque village setting. This thoughtfully planned estate features a selection of beautifully constructed homes that combine contemporary style with energy-efficient features.\n\nSet amidst the tranquil backdrop of Rathnew, Lorrin Lodge benefits from all the village's attractions, including excellent transport connections, reputable schools, and convenient local amenities. Its proximity to the Wicklow Mountains and stunning coastline provides endless opportunities for outdoor activities, while Wicklow Town is just a short drive away for additional leisure and shopping options. Lorrin Lodge is truly the ideal place for those seeking a blend of countryside peace and modern convenience in the heart of County Wicklow.\n\nRycroft has been providing high quality, energy efficeint, affordable homes for over 20 years. They build all types of properties from apartments and townhouses to semi-detached and detached homes within commuting distance of Dublin City Centre.\n\nContact Joint Agents Hooke & MacDonald on 01 631 8402, sales@hmd.ie or Dooley Poynton Acutioneers on 0404 62292, info@wicklowproperty.com\n\n(Please note that the images with furniture are Virtual Images. These are to illustrate to prospective purchasers what can be done with the said rooms)."
